OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright end
OL,6,Fto the day for most with some late
OL,7,Fsunshine. Becoming cloudy overnight
OL,8,Fand turning increasingly damp with
OL,9,Fshowery rain for many by dawn. Breezy
OL,10,Fin coastal regions at first, winds
OL,11,Feasing overnight. Much milder than
OL,12,Flast night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA rather cloudy day with a
OL,15,Fband of light rain and drizzle edging
OL,16,Fsouth across the region. Possibly
OL,17,Fturning a little brighter in the north
OL,18,Flater. Cooler than on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
